{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Background Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a new Coin Hunter. For hunters like you, money means power\u2014literally. Better start racking up that cash.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This place looks like an old store on its last legs\u2026 but why is there such a vast and suspicious space hidden beneath the building? What exactly happened here?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Abandoned \u25a0\u25a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coin Hunter is a single-player, first-person shooter with a twist: instead of bullets, you shoot coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters drop all kinds of coins when defeated, and those coins serve a double purpose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">they\u2019re your ammunition and your currency. Use them wisely\u2014either spend them at the shop for supplies, or load them into your gun and fight your way deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: fight, loot, and survive. Collect more coins, upgrade your attributes, and face off against stronger monsters the further you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/throw.gif?t=1748437246\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And hey\u2026 sometimes, luck might just drop you a jackpot. \ud83d\ude09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/Roll.gif?t=1748437246\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Item Guide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red Potion \u2013 Restores HP</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blue Potion \u2013 Restores stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Green Potion \u2013 Reveals the location of all coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Champagne \u2013 Sacrifice half your HP for a short burst of double damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Energy Drink \u2013 Run faster, move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/HP.gif?t=1748437246\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718660?t=1748437246","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/cd210a3ce2c4fd7178a6f1ea548f8cf21cd4a406/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748437246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/184133ede204910e744bf0c67ae6407414207473/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748437246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/184133ede204910e744bf0c67ae6407414207473/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748437246","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"While playing this game, you may face mutant monsters with pieces of meat/bones. Even though this game adopts a blocky pixel style, players may still feel uncomfortable with it. Please make sure you can accept this mild violent element before playing."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Background Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a new Coin Hunter. For hunters like you, money means power\u2014literally. Better start racking up that cash.</p></li></ul